Z||000000||fiero56||08-26-2000||12:44 AM||||This car lives just a few miles down the street from me, and I absolutely love it! I have always loved the notchback cars, and especially the black bumper pad '84-'86 coupes.<P>This guy took an '84 coupe, added the aero rockers, and fastback clip, but kept the rest stock. This has to be one of the best fastbacks I have ever seen. If I ever buy a fastback, this is what I would want.<P>ps: I took this picture while trying to drive 50mph down a two-lane country road, not easy, so excuse the interior of my car.<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Tof00001.jpg">   <p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 08-26-2000).]||||reg||10
